ok@angeladiet520）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141779485394604032025347.jpeg/sFmQLVMjmAoiJW86IY8n4QnO8G_QTnK-c0gDCHNIAwg\"/><figcaption>營養師Angela分享，只要坐著重複一個簡單動作，就有機會幫助降低餐後血糖。（Facebook@angeladiet520）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"營養師Angela分享，只要坐著重複一個簡單動作，就有機會幫助降低餐後血糖。（Facebook@angeladiet520）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260611/1141779487554801664196780.jpeg/BE72h5zUGG9ufHM7jaIZR0dmKmIChMDha_7Lg2v-y4M\"/><figcaption>營養師Angela分享，只要坐著重複一個簡單動作，就有機會幫助降低餐後血糖。（Facebook@angeladiet520）</figcaption></figure><p>健走後小腿又緊又痛？物理治療師教4招伸展放鬆又緩解痠痛</p><p>走不到1萬步別焦慮！每日健走5000步可降低37%死亡風險</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p><p>本文內容反映原文作者的意見，並不代表《香港01》的立場。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-20T12:04:03.513072+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2293,"images":25,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-20T11:30:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-20T14:17:53.689209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-20T11:57:46.324613+00:00","content_hash":"70776b17615cd3379f5cc699c7dafb255614a0a7f27270b214df3879374285aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}